<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-18458] Sql DML on non-existent table raise NPE</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18458</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;DML operation (INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, MERGE) raise NullPointerException on Calcite engine, if operation is made on non-existent table.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Connect to DB by using JDBC driver&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Execute any DML operation on non-existent table. For example&#160;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
INSERT INTO PERSONBLABLABLA(ID, NAME, AGE) VALUES(1, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;JOHN&apos;&lt;/span&gt;, 3)&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Exception message &lt;b&gt;Failed to validate query. java.lang.NullPointerException&lt;/b&gt; will be returned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
